# Build context for `tools/ci.Dockerfile` only (BuildKit reads
# `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` before the root `.dockerignore`).
#
# The root file is written for the web image and drops `apps/api/`, so this
# Dockerfile's one COPY failed in Nightly: "/apps/api/requirements-dev.lock":
# not found (measured 2026-10-05). The image needs exactly that one file.
*
!apps/api/requirements-dev.lock
